      "en": "Without them `print(sara)` shows `<__main__.Customer object at 0x…>`. `__repr__` is for programmers (shows the object exactly, and appears in lists and the debugger), and `__str__` is for users (a friendly look for print). If you write only one, write `__repr__`."
